title: The Labor Wing
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: never
on-arrival: month_activities += 1; labor_timer += 6
card-image: img/portraits/LeipartTheodor.jpg

= The Labor Wing

The Labor wing are our strongest connection to our grassroots. How shall we make use of their talents?

-	@use_leipart: We will use the talents of the Labor leader, Theodor Leipart
-	@use_aufhauser: We will use the talents of the Labor leader, Siegfried Aufhäuser
-	@use_wissell: We will use the talents of the Labor leader, Rudolf Wissell
-	@use_woytinsky: We will use the talents of the Labor leader, Wladimir Woytinsky
- @use_tarnow: We will use the talents of the Labor leader, Fritz Tarnow
-	@use_baade: We will use the talents of the Labor leader, Fritz Baade
-	@use_hirschfeld: We will use the talents of the Labor leader, Magnus Hirschfeld
-	@use_radbruch: We will use the talents of the Labor leader, Gustav Radbruch
-	@use_stampfer: We will use the talents of the Labor leader, Friedrich Stampfer
- @use_lobe: We will use the talents of the Labor leader, Paul Löbe
-	@use_mierendorff: We will use the talents of the Labor leader, Carlo Mierendorff
-	@use_schumacher: We will use the talents of the Labor leader, Kurt Schumacher
-	@use_leber: We will use the talents of the Labor leader, Julius Leber
- @boost_labor_influence_subtle: We will subtly promote the Labor faction as not to anger any of the other factions.
- @boost_labor_influence_blatant: We will openly promote the Labor faction.
- @welfare: We will use Labor’s connections to promote mutual aid programs for the workers.
- @culture: We will use Labor’s connections to promote sports, educational, and cultural programs.
- @grassroots_relations: We will use Labor’s connections to attempt to build ties with the grassroots elements of the other parties.
- @reduce_labor_dissent: We will work to reduce dissent within the faction.
- @new_labor_leader: [+ labor_leader +] has served well, but new leadership is required.
- @root: We will do none of these things.
- @easy_discard: We will consider this at a later time.

@use_lobe
view-if: labor_leader == "Löbe"
go-to: lobe

@use_leipart
view-if: labor_leader == "Leipart"
go-to: leipart

@use_aufhauser
view-if: labor_leader == "Aufhäuser"
go-to: aufhauser

@use_wissell
view-if: labor_leader == "Wissell"
go-to: wissell

@use_woytinsky
view-if: labor_leader == "Woytinsky"
go-to: woytinsky

@use_tarnow
view-if: labor_leader == "Tarnow"
go-to: tarnow

@use_mierendorff
view-if: labor_leader == "Mierendorff"
go-to: mierendorff

@use_schumacher
view-if: labor_leader == "Schumacher"
go-to: schumacher

@use_leber
view-if: labor_leader == "Leber"
go-to: leber

@use_baade
view-if: labor_leader == "Baade"
go-to: baade

@use_hirschfeld
view-if: labor_leader == "Hirschfeld"
go-to: hirschfeld

@use_radbruch
view-if: labor_leader == "Rabdruch"
go-to: radbruch

@use_stampfer
view-if: labor_leader == "Stampfer"
go-to: stampfer

@boost_labor_influence_subtle
on-arrival: labor_strength += 5; labor_dissent -= 3

We have made subtle moves to boost the popularity of the Labor faction.

@boost_labor_influence_blatant
on-arrival: labor_strength += 10; labor_dissent -= 5; center_dissent += 3; reformist_dissent += 3; left_dissent += 3

We have openly promoted the Labor faction, to the anger of the other factions.

@welfare
on-arrival: workers_aid += 1; unemployed_spd += 5*(1 - dissent);

We have increased funding to Workers' Welfare. [? if black_thursday_seen > 0 : In an age of economic crisis, this will be helpful for improving our standing among the unemployed. ?]

@culture
on-arrival: cultural_organizations += 1; left_dissent -= 6; center_dissent -= 6; labor_dissent -= 6; reformist_dissent -= 6; neorevisionist_dissent -= 6

It is not enough for the SPD to solely be a political party. The Worker Singer's League, Worker's Sports, and our schools and libraries are crucial to our members' lives. Funding these organizations makes our members more committed to the party, even when our policies might not be to their liking.

[? if sa_strength > 500 : However, it feels frivolous to spend on sports and choirs when the fascists are murdering us in the streets. ?]

@grassroots_relations
on-arrival: z_relation += 3; ddp_relation += 3 ; dvp_relation += 3 ; dnvp_relation += 3

We have used Labor’s connections to try to build ties with the grassroots of other parties, particularly among their labor elements. We have even reached out to the DVP’s Labor faction and the DNVP’s Christiansozial faction. 

@reduce_labor_dissent
on-arrival: labor_dissent -= 10

We have worked to reduce dissent within the Labor faction.

@new_labor_leader

We must now select a new leader for the Labor Faction.

- @labor_leader_wissell
- @labor_leader_leipart
- @labor_leader_woytinsky
- @labor_leader_aufhauser
- @labor_leader_baade
- @labor_leader_hirschfeld
- @labor_leader_radbruch
- @labor_leader_stampfer
- @labor_leader_lobe
- @labor_leader_mierendorff
- @labor_leader_schumacher
- @labor_leader_leber
- @root: We have changed our minds.
- @easy_discard: We will consider this at a later time.

@labor_leader_leipart
title: Theodor Leipart
subtitle: Theodor Leipart is the leader of the ADGB, the German Trade Union Federation.
view-if: labor_leader != "Leipart" and spd_coleader_1 != "Leipart" and spd_coleader_2 != "Leipart" and spd_coleader_3 != "Leipart"
is-card: true
card-image: img/portraits/LeipartTheodor.jpg
on-arrival: labor_leader = "Leipart"; labor_leader_fullname = "Theodor Leipart"
go-to: death_of_levi if succession_levi == 1; death_of_muller if succession_muller == 1

Theodor Leipart has been agreed as faction leader.

@labor_leader_aufhauser
